{"id":8851843,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8492","number":8492,"state":"merged","title":"修复FlA TND布局下lseOffset越界写导致LSE输出inf问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8492","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8492/issues","body":"## 描述\nFlA 算子在 TND 布局下，CombineSplitKVRes 中 lseOffset 使用绝对 bIdx 计算偏移，当部分 batch 的 S1=0 时，有效 batch 的 lseOffset 越界写入，导致对应位置的 LSE 输出保留为预填的 inf（3e+99）。\n\n## 改动\n- FlashDecodeCompute 中新增 lseBatchOffset 计算，TND/NTD 布局下取 actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx-1] 作为累积 S1 偏移（与 attenOutOffset 的 TND 处理保持一致）\n- CombineSplitKVRes 签名新增 lseBatchOffset 参数，两处 lseOffset 公式用 lseBatchOffset 替代 bIdx\n- 非 TND 布局下 lseBatchOffset 等于 bIdx，行为与改动前一致\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3681\n\n## 测试\n- TND 布局，B=6，Q cumulative seqlen=[1,1,1,1,1,2]，验证 B=1 的 LSE 输出不再为 inf，写入位置正确落在 [10,19] 区间\n- 非 TND 布局下 lseBatchOffset=bIdx，原有行为不受影响\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":3,"assignees":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68832881c8d5363aeb8700a4","login":"gitcode-chenjiao","name":"chenjiao","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gitcode-chenjiao","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68d502180329437872e54496","login":"gcw_kUomxQ2l","name":"liulun0308","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/gcw_kUomxQ2l","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false}],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[{"id":"68d55468c9e33e3d8f4119c6","login":"Andy-lb","name":"Andy-lb","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Andy-lb","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false,"accept_status":"pending"},{"id":"6822c87d24adff5452d7ba18","login":"